{"text": "Finally the king put down the spade and said, I came to you for answers, wise man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you cannot give me any, tell me so, and I will go home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Someone is running toward us, said the hermit, Let us see who it is. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king turned and saw a bearded man running out of the woods, holding his hands against his stomach. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Blood was flowing from under his hands, and when he reached the king, he fell to the ground. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king and the hermit opened his clothes and found a deep wound in his stomach. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king washed the wound and covered it with his handkerchief and a towel that the hermit had. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The blood soaked through again and again, but the king kept changing the bandage until it stopped. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the man felt a little better, he asked for a drink, so the king brought him fresh water. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By then the sun had set, and the air had become cool, so they carried the man into the hut. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The king was so tired that he lay down on the doorstep and slept through the short summer night.", "alignment": {"characters": ["F", "i", "n", "a", "l", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "p", "a", "d", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "I", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "a", "n", "s", "w", "e", "r", "s", ",", " ", "w", "i", "s", "e", " ", "m", "a", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "c", "a", "n", "n", "o", "t", " ", "g", "i", "v", "e", " ", "m", "e", " ", "a", "n", "y", ",", " ", "t", "e", "l", "l", " ", "m", "e", " ", "s", "o", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "I", " ", 